{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>What is Necrosis: Dawn of Dread?</u></strong> <br><i>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread</i> is a tense, first-person co-op survival horror experience that blends the claustrophobic dread of old-school horror games with modern gameplay mechanics. Team up with up to two friends to scavenge supplies, survive brutal encounters, and solve deadly puzzles in a city overwhelmed by the undead. Every match is a desperate fight to survive\u2014with no second chances. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/ezgif-3bfc791ab9220b.gif?t=1745261085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Terrifying Co-op Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience classic survival horror from a new angle. NDOD drops you into large, unpredictable environments filled with relentless enemies, dwindling resources, and no guarantees. The only way out\u2026 is together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tactical FPS Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage limited ammo, choose your shots carefully, and master a variety of weapons. NDOD rewards precision and teamwork\u2014reckless shooting will only get you killed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Engaging Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve layered, interactive puzzles that challenge your observation and deduction skills. These are designed to keep you thinking and actively involved in every mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Twelve Unique Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your squad from a roster of twelve distinct survivors, each with a unique role and special ability\u2014healing, melee takedowns, enemy debuffs, starting gear, and more. Mix and match characters to find the ideal team synergy.<br>Discover and unlock additional <strong>secret characters</strong> as you progress, each bringing new tactics and surprises to your survival toolkit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Massive Replayable Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore <i>fifteen</i> large environments inspired by survival horror classics. From hospitals to city streets, every location is filled with atmosphere, threats, and secrets to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Randomized Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two sessions are the same. Enemy placements, item locations, and some puzzles change each time you play. The experience stays fresh no matter how often you return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Built for Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Session-based design means you can drop in for a quick run or settle in for a night of survival. Perfect for both casual and hardcore co-op players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Automatcher Queue</strong> \u2013 Match with other survivors and use proximity VOIP or text chat to coordinate your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Player Mode</strong> \u2013 Play solo if you prefer, but NDOD is best experienced in co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievements &amp; Unlockables</strong> \u2013 No microtransactions. Unlock cosmetics and rewards through gameplay, not payments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete for the fastest clears and prove your survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Long-Term Roadmap</strong> \u2013 Additional levels, characters, and enemies planned post-launch\u2014all free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No DRM. No Third-Party Accounts.</strong> \u2013 Just buy the game and play. No logins, no restrictions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Game That Respects You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread</i> is developed by a small, independent team with no corporate backing and no interest in exploitative practices. No microtransactions. No always-online requirement. No nonsense. Just pure survival horror\u2014built for players who love the genre.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/ezgif-1840c309965a25.gif?t=1745261085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3155010?t=1745261085","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745261085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/e90864e292bd0ef42b124cbc7d6c66fe16013e93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745261085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/e90864e292bd0ef42b124cbc7d6c66fe16013e93/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745261085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>What is Necrosis: Dawn of Dread?</u></strong> <br><i>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread</i> is a tense, first-person co-op survival horror experience that blends the claustrophobic dread of old-school horror games with modern gameplay mechanics. Team up with up to two friends to scavenge supplies, survive brutal encounters, and solve deadly puzzles in a city overwhelmed by the undead. Every match is a desperate fight to survive\u2014with no second chances. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/ezgif-3bfc791ab9220b.gif?t=1745261085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Terrifying Co-op Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience classic survival horror from a new angle. NDOD drops you into large, unpredictable environments filled with relentless enemies, dwindling resources, and no guarantees. The only way out\u2026 is together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tactical FPS Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage limited ammo, choose your shots carefully, and master a variety of weapons. NDOD rewards precision and teamwork\u2014reckless shooting will only get you killed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Engaging Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve layered, interactive puzzles that challenge your observation and deduction skills. These are designed to keep you thinking and actively involved in every mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Twelve Unique Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your squad from a roster of twelve distinct survivors, each with a unique role and special ability\u2014healing, melee takedowns, enemy debuffs, starting gear, and more. Mix and match characters to find the ideal team synergy.<br>Discover and unlock additional <strong>secret characters</strong> as you progress, each bringing new tactics and surprises to your survival toolkit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Massive Replayable Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore <i>fifteen</i> large environments inspired by survival horror classics. From hospitals to city streets, every location is filled with atmosphere, threats, and secrets to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Randomized Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two sessions are the same. Enemy placements, item locations, and some puzzles change each time you play. The experience stays fresh no matter how often you return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Built for Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Session-based design means you can drop in for a quick run or settle in for a night of survival. Perfect for both casual and hardcore co-op players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Automatcher Queue</strong> \u2013 Match with other survivors and use proximity VOIP or text chat to coordinate your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Player Mode</strong> \u2013 Play solo if you prefer, but NDOD is best experienced in co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievements &amp; Unlockables</strong> \u2013 No microtransactions. Unlock cosmetics and rewards through gameplay, not payments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete for the fastest clears and prove your survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Long-Term Roadmap</strong> \u2013 Additional levels, characters, and enemies planned post-launch\u2014all free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No DRM. No Third-Party Accounts.</strong> \u2013 Just buy the game and play. No logins, no restrictions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Game That Respects You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread</i> is developed by a small, independent team with no corporate backing and no interest in exploitative practices. No microtransactions. No always-online requirement. No nonsense. Just pure survival horror\u2014built for players who love the genre.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/ezgif-1840c309965a25.gif?t=1745261085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Mike Schroder","Swole Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.a